source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The killed opener leaves each later asterisk attached to a word rune, so Jira renders all four literally; jiro keeps them as text.
-- input.jira --
*a*b*c*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*a*b*c*</p>
-- want.md --
\*a\*b\*c\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
